+
+## 3. Request lifecycle
+
+Ortak auth zinciri: route guard -> `get_current_user` -> `resolve_user` -> `_user_from_token`. Token join'i `sepet/api/auth.py:6-15`; 401 kontrolu `sepet/api/auth.py:23-26`; musteri/restoran/kurye kontrolleri `sepet/api/auth.py:33-60`.
+
+| HTTP endpoint | Handler'dan veri tabanina ve geriye akis |
+|---|---|
+| `GET /api/restaurants` | `list_restaurants` (`sepet/api/main.py:33`) filtre kosullarini kurar (`sepet/api/main.py:35-46`), `get_db` acar (`sepet/api/main.py:47`), `restaurant` ve `restaurant_review` okur (`sepet/api/main.py:48-53`), `displayed_rating` cagirir (`sepet/api/main.py:59-61`; `sepet/api/reviews.py:13-15`), kalan filtre/siralama Python'da yapar (`sepet/api/main.py:63-70`) ve listeyi dondurur. |
+| `GET /api/cuisines` | `list_cuisines` (`sepet/api/main.py:73`) `get_db` acar ve `restaurant` tablosundan `DISTINCT cuisine` dondurur (`sepet/api/main.py:75-79`). |
+| `GET /api/restaurants/{restaurant_id}` | `get_restaurant` (`sepet/api/main.py:82`) istege gore `get_optional_user` -> `resolve_user` -> `_user_from_token` calistirir (`sepet/api/auth.py:18-30`); `restaurant`, `menu_item`, `restaurant_review` ve `user` join'ini okur (`sepet/api/main.py:85-99`), rating'i `displayed_rating` ile hesaplar (`sepet/api/main.py:103`), musteri ise `order` ve `restaurant_review` kontrolu yapar (`sepet/api/main.py:106-115`). |
+| `GET /api/orders/{order_id}` | `get_order` (`sepet/api/main.py:119`) auth guard olmadan `order` + `restaurant` okur (`sepet/api/main.py:122-128`), `order_item` okur (`sepet/api/main.py:131-136`) ve tum alanlari JSON olarak dondurur (`sepet/api/main.py:137-139`). |
+| `POST /api/orders` | `create_order` (`sepet/api/main.py:142`) once `require_customer` auth zincirini calistirir (`sepet/api/main.py:143`; `sepet/api/auth.py:23-36`); `restaurant` ve `menu_item` kontrol eder (`sepet/api/main.py:150-164`), toplami/bakiyeyi hesaplar (`sepet/api/main.py:166-180`), `user.balance`'i kosullu dusurur (`sepet/api/main.py:181-186`), `order` insert eder (`sepet/api/main.py:189-203`), `order_item` satirlarini insert eder (`sepet/api/main.py:205-212`) ve id/status/total dondurur (`sepet/api/main.py:214`). |
+| `POST /api/auth/register` | `register` (`sepet/api/accounts.py:59`) `validate_registration` cagirir (`sepet/api/accounts.py:61`; kurallar `40-47`), e-posta tekligini kontrol eder (`sepet/api/accounts.py:63-64`), `user` insert eder (`65-69`), restoran rolunde `restaurant` insert eder (`70-84`), `issue_token` ile `auth_token` insert eder (`85`; `50-56`) ve token/user dondurur (`86`). |
+| `POST /api/auth/login` | `login` (`sepet/api/accounts.py:89`) `user` satirini okur (`92-94`), `verify_password` cagirir (`95`; `sepet/api/db.py:27-33`), `issue_token` ile `auth_token` yazar (`97`; `50-56`) ve token/user dondurur (`98`). |
+| `GET /api/auth/me` | `me` (`sepet/api/accounts.py:101`) `get_current_user` -> `resolve_user` -> `_user_from_token` sonucunu `user_payload` ile dondurur (`sepet/api/accounts.py:102-103`; payload `31-32`; token `sepet/api/auth.py:6-26`). |
+| `POST /api/auth/wallet/topup` | `top_up_wallet` (`sepet/api/accounts.py:110`) tokenli kullaniciyi alir (`111`; `sepet/api/auth.py:23-26`), rol kontrolu yapar (`112-113`), `user.balance` UPDATE eder (`116-119`), guncel bakiyeyi SELECT eder (`122`) ve dondurur (`123`). |
+| `GET /api/orders/history` | `order_history` (`sepet/api/panels.py:68`) `require_customer` zincirini calistirir (`69`), musteriye ait `order`/`restaurant`/`user`/`courier` join'ini okur (`71-80`), her siparisin `order_item` satirlarini `serialize_orders` ile ekler (`81`; `35-49`) ve listeyi dondurur. |
+| `GET /api/restaurant/orders` | `restaurant_orders` (`sepet/api/panels.py:84`) `require_restaurant` zinciriyle token kullanici ve restoran profilini alir (`87`; `sepet/api/auth.py:39-48`), kendi restoraninin `order` kayitlarini join'lerle okur (`90-102`) ve `serialize_orders` ile dondurur (`103`). |
+| `GET /api/restaurant/couriers` | `list_couriers` (`sepet/api/panels.py:106`) `require_restaurant` ile restoran profilini alir (`107`), `courier` satirlarini okur (`110-113`) ve listeler (`114`). |
+| `GET /api/restaurant/menu-items` | `list_menu_items` (`sepet/api/panels.py:117`) `require_restaurant` ile restoran profilini alir (`118`), `menu_item` satirlarini okur (`121-124`) ve listeler (`125`). |
+| `POST /api/restaurant/couriers` | `create_courier` (`sepet/api/panels.py:128`) `require_restaurant` ile yetki/profil alir (`129`), adi kontrol eder (`131-132`), e-posta varligini kontrol eder (`134-135`), `user` insert eder (`136-139`), `courier` insert eder (`141-144`) ve yeni kuryeyi dondurur (`145`). |
+| `POST /api/restaurant/menu-items` | `add_menu_item` (`sepet/api/panels.py:148`) `require_restaurant` ile yetki/profil alir (`149`), `menu_item` insert eder (`152-156`) ve sonucu dondurur (`157`). |
+| `POST /api/restaurant/orders/{order_id}/assign-courier` | `assign_courier` (`sepet/api/panels.py:160`) `require_restaurant` ile yetki/profil alir (`164`), `order` okur (`169-171`), restoran sahipligini kontrol eder (`172-173`), status kontrol eder (`174-175`), restorana ait `courier` kontrol eder (`176-181`), `order` tablosunda kurye/status/zaman UPDATE eder (`182-186`) ve sonucu dondurur (`187`). |
+| `GET /api/courier/orders` | `courier_orders` (`sepet/api/panels.py:190`) `require_courier` ile kurye profilini alir (`191`; `sepet/api/auth.py:51-60`), kendisine atanmis `order` kayitlarini join'lerle okur (`194-203`) ve `serialize_orders` ile dondurur (`204`). |
+| `POST /api/courier/orders/{order_id}/deliver` | `deliver_order` (`sepet/api/panels.py:207`) `require_courier` ile profil alir (`208`), `order` okur (`212-214`), sahiplik ve `kuryede` status kontrolu yapar (`215-218`), status/`delivered_at` UPDATE eder (`219-222`) ve sonucu dondurur (`223`). |
+| `POST /api/orders/{order_id}/confirm_delivery` | `confirm_delivery` (`sepet/api/panels.py:226`) `require_customer` ile kullaniciyi alir (`227`), `order` okur (`230-232`), sahiplik ve `teslim_edildi` kontrolu yapar (`233-236`), status/`confirmed_at` UPDATE eder (`237-240`) ve sonucu dondurur (`241`). |
+| `GET /api/restaurant/earnings` | `restaurant_earnings` (`sepet/api/panels.py:247`) `require_restaurant` ile yetki/profil alir (`248`), tum ve onayli `order` toplamlarini iki SELECT ile okur (`251-263`), ortalama hesaplar (`264`) ve kazanc ozetini dondurur (`265-272`). |
+| `POST /api/restaurants/{restaurant_id}/reviews` | `create_review` (`sepet/api/reviews.py:18`) yorumu dogrular (`24-25`), `require_customer` ile kullaniciyi alir (`22`; `sepet/api/auth.py:23-36`), `restaurant` kontrol eder (`27-31`), `order.status = 'onaylandı'` kontrol eder (`32-38`), daha once yorum var mi bakar (`39-43`), `restaurant_review` insert eder (`44-49`) ve sonucu dondurur (`50`). |
+
+## 4. Data model
+
+| Tablo | Kolonlar | Dokunan endpoint'ler |
+|---|---|---|
+| `restaurant` | `id`, `name`, `cuisine`, `rating`, `delivery_fee`, `min_order`, `eta_minutes`, `image_emoji`, `user_id` (`sepet/api/schema.sql:1-11`). | `GET /api/restaurants` (`sepet/api/main.py:47-62`); `GET /api/cuisines` (`73-79`); `GET /api/restaurants/{id}` (`85-115`); `POST /api/orders` (`150-152`); `POST /api/auth/register` (`accounts.py:70-84`); restoran yetkilendirme ve panel endpoint'leri (`auth.py:42-45`; `panels.py:90-102`, `169-187`, `251-263`); `GET /api/courier/orders` (`panels.py:195-203`); `POST /api/restaurants/{id}/reviews` (`reviews.py:27-31`). |
+| `user` | `id`, `email UNIQUE`, `password_hash`, `role CHECK`, `balance` (`sepet/api/schema.sql:13-19`). | `POST /api/auth/register` (`accounts.py:63-69`); `POST /api/auth/login` (`92-98`); `GET /api/auth/me` ve tum tokenli endpoint'ler (`auth.py:10-15`); `POST /api/auth/wallet/topup` (`accounts.py:116-122`); `POST /api/orders` bakiye dusme (`main.py:181-186`); `POST /api/restaurant/couriers` (`panels.py:136-139`); order panel join'leri (`panels.py:72-101`, `195-200`, `54-59`). |
+| `auth_token` | `token PRIMARY KEY`, `user_id`, `created_at` (`sepet/api/schema.sql:21-25`). | `POST /api/auth/register` ve `POST /api/auth/login` yazar (`accounts.py:50-56`, `85`, `97`); tum tokenli endpoint'ler okur (`auth.py:10-15`). Logout endpoint'i yok; frontend yalnizca local state'i temizler (`AuthContext.tsx:56-59`). |
+| `courier` | `id`, `user_id UNIQUE`, `restaurant_id`, `name` (`sepet/api/schema.sql:27-32`). | `GET /api/restaurant/couriers` (`panels.py:110-113`); `POST /api/restaurant/couriers` (`141-144`); `POST /api/restaurant/orders/{id}/assign-courier` (`176-186`); kurye yetkilendirme `GET /api/courier/orders` ve `POST /api/courier/orders/{id}/deliver` (`auth.py:54-60`; `panels.py:200-222`). |
