+| `reviews.py` -> `auth.py` | Import `sepet/api/reviews.py:5`; guard kullanimi `sepet/api/reviews.py:22`. |
+| `reviews.py` -> `db.py` | Import `sepet/api/reviews.py:6`; `get_db` kullanimi `sepet/api/reviews.py:26`. |
+| `reviews.py` -> `panels.py` | Import `sepet/api/reviews.py:7`; `ReviewInput` kullanimi `sepet/api/reviews.py:21`. |
+| `seed.py` -> `db.py` | Import `sepet/api/seed.py:4`; `hash_password` ve `utc_now` kullanimi `sepet/api/seed.py:193-194`. |
+
+### Frontend
+
+| Bagimlilik | Kanit |
