+| `api.ts` -> `types.ts` | `sepet/web/src/api.ts:1`. |
+| `AuthContext.tsx` -> `api.ts`, `types.ts` | `sepet/web/src/AuthContext.tsx:2-3`. |
+| `CartContext.tsx` -> `types.ts` | `sepet/web/src/CartContext.tsx:2`. |
+| `main.tsx` -> `App.tsx`, `AuthContext.tsx`, `CartContext.tsx`, `styles.css` | `sepet/web/src/main.tsx:4-7`; saglayici agaci `sepet/web/src/main.tsx:9-18`. |
+| `App.tsx` -> `AuthContext.tsx` ve tum sayfalar | `sepet/web/src/App.tsx:1-8`; provider kullanimi `sepet/web/src/App.tsx:11`; route'lar `sepet/web/src/App.tsx:47-54`. |
+| `Account.tsx` -> `AuthContext.tsx` | `sepet/web/src/pages/Account.tsx:3`, `6`. |
+| `Checkout.tsx` -> `api.ts`, `AuthContext.tsx`, `CartContext.tsx` | `sepet/web/src/pages/Checkout.tsx:3-5`. |
+| `OrderPage.tsx` -> `api.ts`, `types.ts` | `sepet/web/src/pages/OrderPage.tsx:3-4`. |
+| `Panel.tsx` -> `AuthContext.tsx` ve rol panelleri | `sepet/web/src/pages/Panel.tsx:2-5`; rol dagitimi `sepet/web/src/pages/Panel.tsx:30-32`. |
+| `RestaurantDetail.tsx` -> `api.ts`, `CartContext.tsx`, `types.ts` | `sepet/web/src/pages/RestaurantDetail.tsx:3-5`. |
+| `Restaurants.tsx` -> `api.ts`, `types.ts` | `sepet/web/src/pages/Restaurants.tsx:3-4`. |
+| `CustomerPanel.tsx` -> `api.ts`, `AuthContext.tsx`, `types.ts` | `sepet/web/src/panels/CustomerPanel.tsx:3-5`. |
