+| `CourierPanel.tsx` -> `api.ts`, `types.ts` | `sepet/web/src/panels/CourierPanel.tsx:2-3`. |
+
+## 3. Request lifecycle
+
+Ortak auth zinciri: route guard -> `get_current_user` -> `resolve_user` -> `_user_from_token`. Token join'i `sepet/api/auth.py:6-15`; 401 kontrolu `sepet/api/auth.py:23-26`; musteri/restoran/kurye kontrolleri `sepet/api/auth.py:33-60`.
+
+| HTTP endpoint | Handler'dan veri tabanina ve geriye akis |
+|---|---|
+| `GET /api/restaurants` | `list_restaurants` (`sepet/api/main.py:33`) filtre kosullarini kurar (`sepet/api/main.py:35-46`), `get_db` acar (`sepet/api/main.py:47`), `restaurant` ve `restaurant_review` okur (`sepet/api/main.py:48-53`), `displayed_rating` cagirir (`sepet/api/main.py:59-61`; `sepet/api/reviews.py:13-15`), kalan filtre/siralama Python'da yapar (`sepet/api/main.py:63-70`) ve listeyi dondurur. |
+| `GET /api/cuisines` | `list_cuisines` (`sepet/api/main.py:73`) `get_db` acar ve `restaurant` tablosundan `DISTINCT cuisine` dondurur (`sepet/api/main.py:75-79`). |
+| `GET /api/restaurants/{restaurant_id}` | `get_restaurant` (`sepet/api/main.py:82`) istege gore `get_optional_user` -> `resolve_user` -> `_user_from_token` calistirir (`sepet/api/auth.py:18-30`); `restaurant`, `menu_item`, `restaurant_review` ve `user` join'ini okur (`sepet/api/main.py:85-99`), rating'i `displayed_rating` ile hesaplar (`sepet/api/main.py:103`), musteri ise `order` ve `restaurant_review` kontrolu yapar (`sepet/api/main.py:106-115`). |
+| `GET /api/orders/{order_id}` | `get_order` (`sepet/api/main.py:119`) auth guard olmadan `order` + `restaurant` okur (`sepet/api/main.py:122-128`), `order_item` okur (`sepet/api/main.py:131-136`) ve tum alanlari JSON olarak dondurur (`sepet/api/main.py:137-139`). |
+| `POST /api/orders` | `create_order` (`sepet/api/main.py:142`) once `require_customer` auth zincirini calistirir (`sepet/api/main.py:143`; `sepet/api/auth.py:23-36`); `restaurant` ve `menu_item` kontrol eder (`sepet/api/main.py:150-164`), toplami/bakiyeyi hesaplar (`sepet/api/main.py:166-180`), `user.balance`'i kosullu dusurur (`sepet/api/main.py:181-186`), `order` insert eder (`sepet/api/main.py:189-203`), `order_item` satirlarini insert eder (`sepet/api/main.py:205-212`) ve id/status/total dondurur (`sepet/api/main.py:214`). |
+| `POST /api/auth/register` | `register` (`sepet/api/accounts.py:59`) `validate_registration` cagirir (`sepet/api/accounts.py:61`; kurallar `40-47`), e-posta tekligini kontrol eder (`sepet/api/accounts.py:63-64`), `user` insert eder (`65-69`), restoran rolunde `restaurant` insert eder (`70-84`), `issue_token` ile `auth_token` insert eder (`85`; `50-56`) ve token/user dondurur (`86`). |
+| `POST /api/auth/login` | `login` (`sepet/api/accounts.py:89`) `user` satirini okur (`92-94`), `verify_password` cagirir (`95`; `sepet/api/db.py:27-33`), `issue_token` ile `auth_token` yazar (`97`; `50-56`) ve token/user dondurur (`98`). |
+| `GET /api/auth/me` | `me` (`sepet/api/accounts.py:101`) `get_current_user` -> `resolve_user` -> `_user_from_token` sonucunu `user_payload` ile dondurur (`sepet/api/accounts.py:102-103`; payload `31-32`; token `sepet/api/auth.py:6-26`). |
+| `POST /api/auth/wallet/topup` | `top_up_wallet` (`sepet/api/accounts.py:110`) tokenli kullaniciyi alir (`111`; `sepet/api/auth.py:23-26`), rol kontrolu yapar (`112-113`), `user.balance` UPDATE eder (`116-119`), guncel bakiyeyi SELECT eder (`122`) ve dondurur (`123`). |
+| `GET /api/orders/history` | `order_history` (`sepet/api/panels.py:68`) `require_customer` zincirini calistirir (`69`), musteriye ait `order`/`restaurant`/`user`/`courier` join'ini okur (`71-80`), her siparisin `order_item` satirlarini `serialize_orders` ile ekler (`81`; `35-49`) ve listeyi dondurur. |
