+| `auth_token` | `token PRIMARY KEY`, `user_id`, `created_at` (`sepet/api/schema.sql:21-25`). | `POST /api/auth/register` ve `POST /api/auth/login` yazar (`accounts.py:50-56`, `85`, `97`); tum tokenli endpoint'ler okur (`auth.py:10-15`). Logout endpoint'i yok; frontend yalnizca local state'i temizler (`AuthContext.tsx:56-59`). |
+| `courier` | `id`, `user_id UNIQUE`, `restaurant_id`, `name` (`sepet/api/schema.sql:27-32`). | `GET /api/restaurant/couriers` (`panels.py:110-113`); `POST /api/restaurant/couriers` (`141-144`); `POST /api/restaurant/orders/{id}/assign-courier` (`176-186`); kurye yetkilendirme `GET /api/courier/orders` ve `POST /api/courier/orders/{id}/deliver` (`auth.py:54-60`; `panels.py:200-222`). |
+| `restaurant_review` | `id`, `restaurant_id`, `user_id`, `rating CHECK`, `comment`, `created_at`, restoran+kullanici unique (`sepet/api/schema.sql:34-42`). | `GET /api/restaurants` ortalama icin okur (`main.py:49-53`); `GET /api/restaurants/{id}` yorumlari ve `has_review` okur (`94-99`, `112-115`); `POST /api/restaurants/{id}/reviews` kontrol eder ve yazar (`reviews.py:39-49`). |
+| `menu_item` | `id`, `restaurant_id`, `name`, `description`, `price`, `category` (`sepet/api/schema.sql:44-51`). | `GET /api/restaurants/{id}` menu listeler (`main.py:90-93`); `POST /api/orders` urunleri ve fiyatlari okur (`157-166`, `205-212`); `GET /api/restaurant/menu-items` (`panels.py:121-124`); `POST /api/restaurant/menu-items` yazar (`152-156`). |
+| `order` | `id`, `restaurant_id`, `address`, `phone`, `note`, `total`, `status`, `created_at`, `customer_id`, `courier_id`, `courier_assigned_at`, `delivered_at`, `confirmed_at` (`sepet/api/schema.sql:53-67`). | `GET /api/orders/{id}` (`main.py:122-128`); `POST /api/orders` (`189-203`); `GET /api/orders/history` (`panels.py:71-80`); `GET /api/restaurant/orders` (`90-102`); kurye atama/teslim/onay (`169-186`, `212-222`, `230-240`); `GET /api/courier/orders` (`194-203`); `GET /api/restaurant/earnings` (`251-263`); restoran detayinda yorum hakkı (`main.py:107-111`); yorum onay kontrolu (`reviews.py:32-36`). |
+| `order_item` | `id`, `order_id`, `menu_item_id`, `name`, `unit_price`, `quantity` (`sepet/api/schema.sql:69-76`). | `POST /api/orders` yazar (`main.py:205-212`); `GET /api/orders/{id}` okur (`131-136`); `serialize_orders` gecmis/panel/kurye listelerinde okur (`panels.py:39-47`). |
